{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026185ySdzsNV1794212026.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>由高海寧、周嘉洛及朱敏瀚擔任主持的節目《Grand住去首爾》日前播出重磅一集，邀請到韓國經典綜藝《Running Man》元老金鍾國擔任特別嘉賓。事後，周嘉洛在社交平台大晒與金鍾國互動的花絮片段及合照，隨即引起大批網民熱議。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"adbd1a15-25a9-4648-9031-04839926b9bf.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026NjWiRn8LQG1794212025.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"79560015-6d7a-4233-96d1-41e6da5aba49.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20265wv4eGnLmN1794212024.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>周嘉洛在上載的花絮中尊稱金鍾國為韓文的「형❤️」（哥哥），並興奮留言：「i love him i lost control」。從影片及相片中可見，兩人互動相當親密，金鍾國不僅在餐桌前親手包好生菜包肉餵給周嘉洛吃，更在健身房親自為他指導及調整健身姿勢。周嘉洛在「能力者」金鍾國身旁秒變狂熱迷弟，除搭着對方肩膀擺出各種搞笑表情合照外，亦緊握拳頭擺出肌肉姿勢，場面十分歡樂。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.112265+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":297,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T08:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:37:15.956752+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:30.919825+00:00","content_hash":"c07a0f3f6facb23c7cecbeac042f362f5fc204f809e3c44cdd61584a2f47b2e1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}